1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,000
Don't blindly trust your son's voice on Telegram.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,100
AI can copy it.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,900
“I know his face, his voice, his habits.”

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
“Mom, send money fast, I'll explain later.”

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,000
But the mother typed one question.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,800
The copy couldn't answer.

7
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:41,000
AI copies a face and a voice.

8
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:45,400
But it can't copy memories and love.

9
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,600
Agree on a secret word with your family.

